    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DIVE INTO THE WORLD OF AMERICAN STREET RACING </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lead The Dragon</strong>\u00a0combines arcade gameplay with realistic handling , togglable driving assists delivers a pleasing experience for both casual and sim racers. Explore the open world of the\u00a0twisty roads inspired by the <i>Tail of The Dragon</i> ,\u00a0Interact and challenge rivals in the free roam , escape from the cops and upgrade your car with detailed car customization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You have to join a crew! There are 3 different crews, each with their own characteristics, delivering gameplay variety and high replayability.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >American Crew (Anti-police equipament , more crash resistance but challenging RWD handling)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >European Crew (Light Cars , Better AWD Handling, Fragile to crashes , Pace notes system)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Japanese Crew (High Tunning Potential , Drift Focused , Middle Term)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INTERACT AND CHALLENGE RIVALS IN THE FREE ROAM:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Point to point races</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drift challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distance based races</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time Trails</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COPS WILL HUNT YOU! </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roadblocks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pit manuvers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spike strips</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Helicopters</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DIVE INTO THE WORLD OF AMERICAN STREET RACING </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lead The Dragon</strong>\u00a0combines arcade gameplay with realistic handling , togglable driving assists delivers a pleasing experience for both casual and sim racers. Explore the open world of the\u00a0twisty roads inspired by the <i>Tail of The Dragon</i> ,\u00a0Interact and challenge rivals in the free roam , escape from the cops and upgrade your car with detailed car customization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You have to join a crew! There are 3 different crews, each with their own characteristics, delivering gameplay variety and high replayability.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >American Crew (Anti-police equipament , more crash resistance but challenging RWD handling)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >European Crew (Light Cars , Better AWD Handling, Fragile to crashes , Pace notes system)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Japanese Crew (High Tunning Potential , Drift Focused , Middle Term)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INTERACT AND CHALLENGE RIVALS IN THE FREE ROAM:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Point to point races</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drift challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distance based races</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time Trails</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COPS WILL HUNT YOU! </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roadblocks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pit manuvers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spike strips</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Helicopters</p></li></ul>",
